    "updated_at": "2021-09-08T06:56:13Z",
    "body": "This would mean that something like `Promise.resolve()` cannot be expressed through Web IDL.\r\n\r\nIt does seem useful as it's the kind of code you would expect to work, but I worry about the mismatch with JavaScript in general becoming a problem for developers as they would have to know about this and the difference between Web IDL and non-Web IDL APIs.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
