    "updated_at": "2021-09-08T14:58:09Z",
    "body": "So far the only promise-accepting APIs in JS are the promise combinators themselves, which I think should be exempt from this sort of special-casing. I do think if ES introduces new promise-accepting APIs (although it's hard to imagine what), they should follow the precedent we set here.",
